      "description": "Studio-only save and simulation actions.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-studio-primary\" type=\"button\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z\"/><path d=\"M17 21v-8H7v8M7 3v5h8\"/></svg>변경 저장</button>",
      "css": ".ds-studio-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;font:600 12px/18px var(--font-sans,sans-serif);white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid #21634d;background:#21634d;color:white;}.ds-studio-primary:hover{background:#164d3a;}.ds-studio-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #21634d;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-studio-primary:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Studio secondary button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "studio-button-secondary",
      "description": "Studio-only supporting actions, such as adding a stage.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-studio-secondary\" type=\"button\">단계 추가</button>",
      "css": ".ds-studio-secondary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px;min-height:36px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;font:600 12px/18px var(--font-sans,sans-serif);white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid #cbd8cf;background:white;color:#20342c;}.ds-studio-secondary:hover{background:#edf4ef;}.ds-studio-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #21634d;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-studio-secondary:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Studio field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "studio-input",
      "description": "Studio-only labeled field, preserving the selected stage editing treatment.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-studio-label\">단계 이름<input class=\"ds-studio-input\" value=\"사실 수집\" /></label>",
      "css": ".ds-studio-label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;color:#20342c;font:600 12px/18px var(--font-sans,sans-serif);}.ds-studio-input{min-width:0;width:100%;border:1px solid #c8d4cc;border-radius:6px;background:white;color:#20342c;padding:9px 10px;font:inherit;caret-color:#21634d;}.ds-studio-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #21634d;outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Studio workflow node",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "studio-node",
      "description": "Studio-only stage selector; the pressed state keeps the same footprint.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-node\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-node-role\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"/><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/></svg>사실 수집<span class=\"ds-node-status\">LLM</span></span><strong class=\"ds-node-title\">사실 수집</strong><span class=\"ds-node-prompt\">질문에서 확인된 사실과 아직 모르는 사실을 구분하세요.</span><span class=\"ds-node-bottom\">빠른 모델</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-node{display:flex;flex-direction:column;width:230px;height:157px;padding:15px;text-align:left;border:1px solid #c8d7cd;border-radius:12px;background:white;color:#20342c;font:400 14px/21px var(--font-sans,sans-serif);cursor:pointer;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s;}.ds-node:hover{background:#fafdfa;border-color:#21634d;}.ds-node[aria-pressed=true]{border:2px solid #21634d;padding:14px;}.ds-node[data-running=true]{background:#e6f3e9;border-color:#21634d;}.ds-node:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #21634d;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-node-role{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;color:#586b62;}.ds-node-status{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;}.ds-node-title{display:block;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;text-overflow:ellipsis;font-size:15px;margin:10px 0 5px;}.ds-node-prompt{display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;color:#586b62;font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;}.ds-node-bottom{margin-top:auto;padding-top:9px;width:100%;font-size:10px;color:#586b62;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-node{transition:none;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The existing Korean expert workspace",
    "overview": "This is a descriptive record of the incumbent application, not a replacement identity. Korean Pretendard text, dark role-colored navigation, white working surfaces, fine borders and Lucide line icons define the workspace. The expert role uses green; the shared application also retains its blue viewer and amber administrator themes.\n\nAgent Studio extends that workspace with compact editing controls and a diagram surface. Values prefixed `studio-` apply to `/audit/agents`; they do not replace shared tokens. Its canvas, inspector and simulation arrangement is a surface decision documented in [the Agent Studio brief](design/agent-studio.md), not a required composition for future pages. The user approved retaining the existing identity and building this surface in code without raster assets.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Korean interface text in the existing locally loaded Pretendard family.",
      "Role-colored navigation beside restrained, mostly white content surfaces.",
      "Borders and tonal changes carry grouping, selection and feedback.",
      "Agent Studio keeps editing, simulation and recorded data visibly distinct."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Role Scope Rule",
        "body": "Preserve the shared role themes. Studio's green controls are local to Studio and do not redefine the application's shared primary token.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** retain Pretendard, Korean interface language and the incumbent role-colored navigation when extending this workspace.",
      "**Do** distinguish shared tokens from values explicitly scoped to Agent Studio.",
      "**Do** use the existing line icons, borders and tonal states to explain available actions and selection.",
      "**Do** keep Studio's simulation labels, concrete validation messages and inspectable trace data visible in the relevant task view.",
      "**Do** preserve keyboard focus treatments and the node reduced-motion override."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** replace the application's identity or convert its shared primary color to Studio green as part of this extension.",
      "**Don't** make Studio's three-panel composition, diagram grid or local radii mandatory for unrelated screens.",
      "**Don't** present sample confidence as measured accuracy or browser-local demo separation as production privacy.",
      "**Don't** treat verification screenshots as shipping product imagery."
    ]
  }
}
